# Every file in this repo is a signed Windows driver payload. NEVER let
# git modify byte contents -- .cat files sign hashes of the .inf/.sys/.cat
# contents and any CRLF <-> LF conversion invalidates every signature,
# causing SPAPI_E_DRIVER_STORE_ADD_FAILED (0xE000024B) on install.
*                     binary
*.sys                 binary
*.cat                 binary
*.inf                 binary
